# After S-944, Number and Float are plain VarRefs (Pattern::TypeAssertPending is deleted).
# Number resolves to a class dict from prelude; Float resolves to TypeNode.Float.
# Pin comparisons: primitive_eq(3.14, Number-class) = false, primitive_eq(3.14, TypeNode.Float) = false.
# The wildcard arm fires.
[match 3.14
    Number:  "numeric"
    Float:   "text"
    ...:     "other"]
=== out
String("other")
